--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Notes on the provenance of the data
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

1. Underlying statutes. The Straßenverkehrs-Ordnung (StVO) and the Bürgerliches
   Gesetzbuch (BGB) are amtliche Werke under § 5 UrhG and are not subject to
   copyright protection in Germany.

2. Translations. The English text in data/source/ and throughout the QA pairs is
   machine translation produced by this project (m2m100_418M and opus-mt-de-en).
   It is not an official translation and has no legal standing. It contains
   translation errors.

3. Model-generated content. The QA pairs were generated by
   Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.2, Llama-2-7b-chat-hf, and
   Chocolatine-14B-Instruct-DPO-v1.2. The licence terms of those models —
   in particular the Llama 2 Community License — may attach to their outputs
   independently of the CC BY 4.0 grant above. If you redistribute this data or
   build products on it, review those terms for your own use case.

4. Not legal advice. This corpus is a machine-learning research artefact
   containing deliberately incorrect answers as negative training examples. It
   must not be used as a source of legal information.
